                <h3 class="pcard__title">Trying another approach means another chat.</h3>
                <p class="pcard__body">You explain the problem again, and the first attempt’s context stays behind in the old one.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="pcard" tabindex="0">
                <p class="pcard__rail tag"><span>Recovery</span><span>[02]</span></p>
                <svg class="pcard__fig" viewBox="0 0 240 170" aria-hidden="true">
